{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And what, etc.</b> The meaning: all this is their calamity. And behold, what will you do on the day of YHWH's visitation, when HaShem visits your iniquities?" "<b>Your glory.</b> It is the multitude."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Resolved יו' as abbreviation for יום (day); the construct chain יום שיפקוד השם read as 'the day of YHWH's visitation.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:05.720263307Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}